---
import Social from './Social.astro';
---

<style>
  footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .social-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    color: white;
    background-color: #4c1d95;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .contact-info ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-info li {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .copyright {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #888;
  }
</style>

<footer>
  <div class="social-links">
    <a href="https://info.ahaja.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button" aria-label="생터성경사역원">
      생터홈페이지
    </a>
    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ahaja_official" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button" aria-label="instagram">
      Instagram
    </a>
    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@%EC%83%9D%ED%84%B0%EC%84%B1%EA%B2%BD%EC%82%AC%EC%97%AD%EC%9B%90" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button" aria-label="youtube">
      YouTube
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-info">
    <ul>
      <li>생터성경사역원 미디어팀</li>
      <li>전화: 043-236-3927 (내선 2)</li>
      <li>주소: 충북 청주시 흥덕구 오송읍 연제1길25</li>
      <li class="copyright">Copyright &copy; Life Place Bible Ministries. All Rights Reserved.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</footer>